{"id":"vod_sn_36350","vodId":"36350","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"网球王子 全国大赛篇","name_cn":"网球王子 全国大赛篇","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c46306471bc2543a2311a8226b5d76fc.jpg"},"summary":"青春学园网球部称霸全国的目标又向前迈进了一步。代表中学网球最高水平的全国大赛开始了。之前饱受伤病困扰的部长手冢国光（置鲇龙太郎 配音）彻底愈合回归，而越前龙马（皆川纯子 配音）也从美国回到了日本，声称自己只是来加油的。青学迎战的第一场是来自冲绳的六角中学。六角中学故意伪造意外事故，让青学陷入了困境，为了能让青学获胜，大石（近藤孝行 配音）决定让龙马替自己征战。经过一番苦战，青春学园进入到了下一轮，而面对他们的是老对手——冰帝。这将是一番苦战！除此之外，之前在正片中出场的各大学校也将登场，进行最激烈的全国大赛。　　本片改编自许斐刚的同名热门漫画全国大赛卷。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2NWVYExVj81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1LM92FBwhZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0gBifz3s1Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SEcdnvv4Ge1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xpzY7xVXuh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yuWB32Z6Wa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NW7kXjXnNX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q8xUq7EkFt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2j8HjFkRzb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Gc5br95hzD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E2hfjMHYji1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/udxsxgvVbZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U7V8KnPGSW1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:24.328Z"}